  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than three years from the date of this decision.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: 1, 2, 3, 4, NM14SJR01, 220719, S.SLP, Design, Access And Heritage Statement, Fire Statement, Arboricultural Impact Assessment, Arboricultural Method Statement, Wheelchair Policy Received 02 November 2022; P001B, P002C, P003C, P004C, P005C Received 27 January 20223.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building, unless otherwise shown on the approved plans.",
    "Condition : 5 - The expanded Class E(e) (dental practice) use at 14 St John's Road, TW7 6NN shall not be carried on outside the following times: 0900 - 1800 Monday to Friday; 0900 - 1700 Saturday.",
    "Condition : 6 - The site shall remain within use as a Class E(e) dental practice and shall not be converted to other uses within Class E of the General Permitted Development Order.",
    "Condition : 7 - Before the development hereby permitted is first occupied or brought into use, the existing vehicular access to 14 St Johns Road shall be permanently closed and kerbs and footway reinstated so that it cannot be used as an access across the pavement.",
    "Condition : 8 - Secure covered cycle parking facilities for not less than 5 bicycles for the occupants of, and visitors to, the development shall be installed at the front of the property. The approved facilities shall conform to the current Westtrans West London Cycle Parking Guidance (or such other guidance as shall supersede it) in design and layout and be fully implemented and made available for use before the first occupation of the development or commencement of the approved use as appropriate and thereafter retained for use at all times without obstruction."
  ],
